      "id": "claim_47ec3d71bd9445a0884fd85754f7dce1",
      "statement": "Discovery is build-time only: src/kata/load.ts uses import.meta.glob('../../katas/*.md', {query:'?raw', eager:true}) to inline every katas/*.md file as a raw string at build time, with no manifest and no runtime filesystem scan; adding a kata requires dropping a .md file and rebuilding.",
